  "descriptionEn": "The PivotGrid component can display data from an array of objects. Use the dataSource property to bind the PivotGrid to data. This property accepts a PivotGridDataSource instance or its configuration object. Assign your array to the store property of PivotGridDataSource. To display data in the PivotGrid, assign an array to the fields[] property. Each object in this array configures a single pivot grid field. Assign a field name to the dataField property to populate the pivot grid field with data.",
